sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Process Engine
  participant A as Agent adapter (host)
  participant R as Rule Engine
  participant H as Human task
  P->>A: bounded inputs, output schema, timeout
  A-->>P: structured output
  P->>P: validate output against schema
  P->>R: evaluate guardrail rule set on output
  R-->>P: allow / route to human / fail
  alt allow
    P->>P: continue to next step
  else route to human
    P->>H: approval task with agent output and rule reasons
    H-->>P: approve or reject
  else fail or timeout
    P->>P: retry, then incident
  end
  Note over P,R: every step recorded in history and decision log
